@startuml
title Figure 10: System Sequence Diagram - Overall Issue Lifecycle

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Staff" as Staff
actor "HOD" as HOD
actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "Frontend" as UI
participant "Backend\nAPI" as API
participant "Issue\nService" as IssueSvc
participant "Notification\nService" as NotifSvc
participant "Email\nService" as Email
database "Database" as DB

== Phase 1: Issue Reporting (Staff) ==

Staff -> UI: Report New Issue
UI -> API: POST /api/issues/create
API -> IssueSvc: createIssue(dto)
IssueSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO issues\n(status='OPEN', reported_by=Staff)
DB --> IssueSvc: Issue Created (ID: #1)
IssueSvc -> NotifSvc: notifyHOD()
NotifSvc -> DB: INSERT notification\n(user_id=HOD, type='NEW_ISSUE')
NotifSvc -> Email: sendEmail(HOD)
IssueSvc --> API: IssueResponse
API --> UI: 201 Created
UI --> Staff: Issue #1 Reported

== Phase 2: Issue Assignment (HOD) ==

HOD -> UI: View Department Issues
UI -> API: GET /api/issues/department
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM issues\nWHERE department = 'Finance'
DB --> API: Issue List
API --> UI: {issues[]}
UI --> HOD: Display Issues\n(Issue #1: OPEN)

HOD -> UI: Assign Issue #1 to Staff
UI -> API: PUT /api/issues/1/assign\n{assignedTo: Staff}
API -> IssueSvc: assignIssue(1, Staff)
IssueSvc -> DB: UPDATE issues\nSET assigned_to = Staff
DB --> IssueSvc: Updated
IssueSvc -> NotifSvc: notifyStaff()
NotifSvc -> DB: INSERT notification\n(type='ISSUE_ASSIGNED')
NotifSvc -> Email: sendEmail(Staff)
IssueSvc --> API: Success
API --> UI: 200 OK
UI --> HOD: Issue Assigned

== Phase 3: Work in Progress (Staff) ==

Staff -> UI: Open Assigned Issue #1
UI -> API: GET /api/issues/1
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM issues WHERE id = 1
DB --> API: Issue (status='OPEN')
API --> UI: {issue}
UI -> API: PUT /api/issues/1/status\n{status: 'IN_PROGRESS'}
API -> IssueSvc: updateStatus(1, 'IN_PROGRESS')
IssueSvc -> DB: UPDATE issues\nSET status = 'IN_PROGRESS'
DB --> IssueSvc: Updated
IssueSvc -> NotifSvc: notifyStatusChange()
NotifSvc -> DB: INSERT notification\n(user_id=HOD)
NotifSvc -> Email: sendEmail(HOD)
IssueSvc --> API: Success
API --> UI: 200 OK
UI --> Staff: Status: IN_PROGRESS

Staff -> UI: Add Comment\n"Working on fix..."
UI -> API: POST /api/issues/1/comments
API -> DB: INSERT INTO issue_comments
DB --> API: Comment Added
API --> UI: Success
UI --> Staff: Comment Posted

== Phase 4: Issue Resolution (Staff) ==

Staff -> UI: Mark Issue as Resolved
UI -> API: PUT /api/issues/1/resolve
API -> IssueSvc: resolveIssue(1)
IssueSvc -> DB: UPDATE issues\nSET status = 'RESOLVED',\nresolved_at = NOW()
DB --> IssueSvc: Updated
IssueSvc -> NotifSvc: notifyHOD()
NotifSvc -> DB: INSERT notification\n(type='ISSUE_RESOLVED')
NotifSvc -> Email: sendEmail(HOD)
IssueSvc --> API: Success
API --> UI: 200 OK
UI --> Staff: Issue Resolved\n(Awaiting HOD Approval)

== Phase 5: Issue Closure (HOD) ==

HOD -> UI: View Resolved Issues
UI -> API: GET /api/issues/department?status=RESOLVED
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM issues\nWHERE status = 'RESOLVED'
DB --> API: Resolved Issues
API --> UI: {issues[]}
UI --> HOD: Display Issue #1\n(RESOLVED)

HOD -> UI: Review & Close Issue
UI -> API: PUT /api/issues/1/close
API -> IssueSvc: closeIssue(1, HOD)
IssueSvc -> DB: UPDATE issues\nSET status = 'CLOSED',\nclosed_by = HOD,\nclosed_at = NOW()
DB --> IssueSvc: Updated
IssueSvc -> NotifSvc: notifyStaff()
NotifSvc -> DB: INSERT notification\n(type='ISSUE_CLOSED')
NotifSvc -> Email: sendEmail(Staff)
IssueSvc -> DB: INSERT audit_log\n(action='ISSUE_CLOSED')
IssueSvc --> API: Success
API --> UI: 200 OK
UI --> HOD: Issue #1 Closed

== Phase 6: Admin Oversight ==

Admin -> UI: View All Issues
UI -> API: GET /api/issues/all
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM issues\n(All Departments)
DB --> API: All Issues
API --> UI: {issues[]}
UI --> Admin: Display All Issues\n(Read-Only)

Admin -> UI: Add Guidance Comment
UI -> API: POST /api/issues/1/comments\n{content: "Good resolution"}
API -> DB: INSERT INTO issue_comments\n(user_id=Admin)
DB --> API: Comment Added
API --> UI: Success
UI --> Admin: Comment Added

Admin -> UI: Generate System Report
UI -> API: POST /api/reports/generate
API -> DB: SELECT statistics\n(All Issues, Departments)
DB --> API: Aggregated Data
API -> API: Generate PDF Report
API --> UI: Report File
UI --> Admin: Download Report

== Optional: Reopen Issue (HOD) ==

HOD -> UI: Reopen Closed Issue
UI -> API: PUT /api/issues/1/reopen
API -> IssueSvc: reopenIssue(1)
IssueSvc -> DB: UPDATE issues\nSET status = 'IN_PROGRESS',\nclosed_by = NULL,\nclosed_at = NULL
DB --> IssueSvc: Updated
IssueSvc -> NotifSvc: notifyStaff()
NotifSvc -> DB: INSERT notification\n(type='ISSUE_REOPENED')
IssueSvc --> API: Success
API --> UI: 200 OK
UI --> HOD: Issue Reopened

@enduml
